 "score": 0.5087, "filing_name": "Target Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/27419/000002741925000018/tgt-20250201.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0024", "ticker": "TGT", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-02-01", "section": "business", "score": 0.722, "filing_name": "Target Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/27419/000002741925000018/tgt-20250201.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0017", "ticker": "TGT", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-02-01", "section": "business", "score": 0.5905, "filing_name": "Target Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/27419/000002741925000018/tgt-20250201.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__business__0000", "ticker": "TGT", "form": "10-K", "fiscal_label": "FY2025", "period_end": "2025-02-01", "section": "business", "score": 0.5121, "filing_name": "Target Corporation 10-K FY2025", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/27419/000002741925000018/tgt-20250201.htm", "truncated": false}], "collapsed_near_duplicates": 15, "dropped_candidates": 39, "token_estimate": 29529, "gaps": [], "degraded": []}, "answer": {"direct_answer": "Target's fiscal 2025 10-K (ended February 1, 2025) groups its risks into competitive and reputational, investment and infrastructure, information security, supply chain and third-party, legal and regulatory, and financial categories. The competitive and reputational risks include failing to differentiate from competitors and damage to Target's reputation, including from conflicting ESG and DEI expectations [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0000] [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0005]. Supply chain exposure is significant: China is the single largest source of imported merchandise, and U.S. tariffs could raise costs and prices [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0020] [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0021]. Target also cites cybersecurity and data privacy risk, noting it previously experienced a prominent data breach [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0017], and a dependence on U.S. consumer spending because nearly all sales are in the U.S. [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0024]. Inventory shrink, demand forecasting errors, and ongoing securities litigation are further stated risks [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0009] [TGT_10K_2025-02-01__legal_proceedings__0000]. The filing does not rank these risks, so no order of severity is implied.", "company_findings": [{"ticker": "TGT", "company": "Target Corporation", "findings": [{"point": "Reputation and ESG/DEI: Target has faced consumer boycotts and litigation over conflicting expectations, including its 2023 Pride Month assortment, and adverse reactions to modifying DEI initiatives.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0005", "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0006"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Supply chain and trade: China is the largest import source, and recently imposed or threatened U.S. tariffs could raise procurement costs and force price increases.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0020", "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0021"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Macroeconomic dependence: nearly all sales are in the U.S., so results depend on the U.S. economy and consumer confidence and spending.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0024"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Information security: cyberattacks are growing more sophisticated, and Target previously experienced a prominent data breach that could draw greater scrutiny to future incidents.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0016", "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0017"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Inventory and demand: elevated inventory shrink has adversely affected results and contributed to store closures, and Target has not always predicted consumer demand accurately.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0009", "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0010"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Legal and regulatory: Target faces securities class actions over prior ESG/DEI risk disclosures, and Shipt faces legal challenges to its worker classification.", "citations": ["TGT_10K_2025-02-01__legal_proceedings__0000", "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0031"], "unverified": false}]}], "comparison_table": null, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0000", "claim": "Risks organized by headings; differentiation risk", "quote": "If we fail to differentiate our guest experience from our competitors, our results of operations and financial condition could be adversely affected."}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0005", "claim": "Pride Month reaction, boycotts, litigation", "quote": "which have previously resulted in consumer boycotts and litigation"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0006", "claim": "DEI modification drew adverse reactions", "quote": "we modified and concluded certain of our initiatives related to diversity, equity, and inclusion"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0020", "claim": "China largest import source", "quote": "with China as our single largest source of merchandise we import"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0021", "claim": "Tariff cost and pricing risk", "quote": "could result in us incurring substantial additional costs to procure a large portion of the merchandise we offer"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0024", "claim": "Dependence on U.S. economy", "quote": "Nearly all of our sales are in the U.S., making our results highly dependent on the health of the U.S. economy"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0016", "claim": "Evolving cyber threats", "quote": "cyber threats continue to evolve and cyberattacks become more sophisticated and frequent"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0017", "claim": "Prior data breach draws scrutiny", "quote": "Since we previously experienced a prominent data breach, additional information security, cybersecurity, or data privacy incidents could draw greater scrutiny."}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0009", "claim": "Elevated shrink and demand forecasting", "quote": "we have experienced elevated levels of inventory shrink relative to historical levels"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0010", "claim": "Shrink contributed to store closures", "quote": "contributed, and may continue to contribute, to the closure of certain stores and the impairment of long-term assets"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__legal_proceedings__0000", "claim": "Securities class actions over ESG disclosures", "quote": "named as defendants in two purported federal securities law class actions"}, {"chunk_id": "TGT_10K_2025-02-01__risk_factors__0031", "claim": "Shipt worker classification challenges", "quote": "has faced, and continues to face, legal challenges to its worker classification"}], "coverage": {"companies_used": [{"ticker": "TGT", "forms": ["10-K"], "fiscal_periods": ["fiscal 2025, ended February 1, 2025"]}], "companies_missing": [], "data_as_of": "2025-03-12"}, "gaps": ["filings_available: TGT has only one 10-K (fiscal 2025, ended February 1, 2025) in the corpus, so changes in risk disclosure over time cannot be assessed.", "The filing does not rank its risks by severity or likelihood, so 'main' risks reflect stated themes, not a ranked list.", "No 10-Q risk factor updates are in the context, so changes after the fiscal 2025 10-K are not covered.", "Some risk factor chunks are partial or table-of-contents fragments, so a few disclosed risks may not be fully captured."], "confidence": "medium", "confidence_reason": "The risk factors section is well covered by the retrieved chunks and every claim is cited, but the fili